.TH PLASMA-GRAPHSYNC-LINUX 1 "November 2026" "plasma-graphsync-linux @PROJECT_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
plasma-graphsync-linux \- Graph Sync, a sync client for Microsoft OneDrive and SharePoint on KDE Plasma
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B plasma-graphsync-linux
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ url ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The Graph Sync app: the setup wizard, the settings (locations, accounts, notifications,
advanced), and the windows for Share, Version History and the SharePoint Sync button. Without
options it opens the settings, or the setup wizard on the first start. The syncing itself is done
by
.BR graphsyncd (1).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-setup
Run the setup wizard.
.TP
.B \-\-add
Add a library of the current account.
.TP
.B \-\-add\-personal
Sync the current account's own OneDrive.
.TP
.B \-\-add\-account
Sign in to another account.
.TP
.B \-\-sign\-in
Sign the current account in again.
.TP
.B \-\-choose\-folders \fIROOT\fP
Choose which folders of a location are synced.
.TP
.BR \-\-share " \fIPATH\fP, " \-\-copy\-link " \fIPATH\fP, " \-\-versions " \fIPATH\fP, " \-\-view\-online " \fIPATH\fP"
Share a synced file or folder, copy a link to it, show its version history, or open it online.
.TP
.B \-\-download
Download the given online-only files (name.cloud) without opening them.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show all options, including those for testing.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I url
An odopen:// link from the SharePoint Sync button, a .url shortcut or an online-only .cloud file.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR graphsyncctl (1),
.BR graphsyncd (1)
.PP
https://github.com/nvaert1986/plasma-graphsync-linux
